["<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">分かる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">わかる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">理解；领会；明白；变得清楚；被了解；被发现；被意识到；被发觉；讲得通；我明白了；我也这么想</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"196088\">ボブがいつ<ruby>来日<rp>(</rp><rt>らいにち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>したか<ruby>分<rp>(</rp><rt>わ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>からない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我不知道博布什么时候来了。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">別れ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">わかれ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">分别；离别；告别；分手；（恋人或夫妻）分开；关系破裂</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"185457\"><ruby>会<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>うは<ruby>別<rp>(</rp><rt>わか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れの<ruby>始<rp>(</rp><rt>はじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>め。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">见面是告别的开始。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">分かれる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">わかれる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">分叉；分支；岔开；分离；分开；分裂；散开；散去；消散</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"206514\">その<ruby>問題<rp>(</rp><rt>もんだい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>上院議員<rp>(</rp><rt>じょういんぎいん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>意見<rp>(</rp><rt>いけん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>分<rp>(</rp><rt>わ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かれた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">参议院议员的意见分歧。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">別れる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">わかれる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">分别；离别；告别；分手；离婚；分离；与亲人死别；丧亲；失去（亲人）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"215473\">ジョンとメアリーは<ruby>先週<rp>(</rp><rt>せんしゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>別<rp>(</rp><rt>わか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">约翰和玛丽在上周分手。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">若々しい</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">わかわかしい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">年轻的；年轻的外表；充满朝气的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"88181\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>相変<rp>(</rp><rt>あいか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>わらず<ruby>若々<rp>(</rp><rt>わかわか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她总是如此年轻。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">わがまま</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">自私；利己主义者；任性；随心所欲；蛮横</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"90316\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>決<rp>(</rp><rt>けっ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>してわがままではない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她从来不是无情的。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">脇</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">わき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">腋下；臂下；侧面；侧翼；旁边；身边；靠近；邻近；一旁；偏离；置之一隅；离题；题外；配角；助演；次要角色；联句中的第二句</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"120727\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がブリーフケースを<ruby>脇<rp>(</rp><rt>わき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>抱<rp>(</rp><rt>かか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えてやってくるのが<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他看见他带着布里夫袋在旁边。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">枠</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">わく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">框架；框架结构；边框；方框；框；限制；限额；配额；类别；范围；等级；时段；播出时段；直播；网络直播；线轴；卷轴</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"201889\">ドアが<ruby>枠<rp>(</rp><rt>わく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>合<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>わなければ<ruby>合<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>うまでドアにかんなをかけなければならない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">如果门不符合框架,就必须在门上打开,直到它相匹配。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">沸く</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">わく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">（水等）变热；沸腾；烧开；沸腾；欢腾；热烈进行；发酵；酝酿；（金属）熔化；熔解</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"168382\"><ruby>市<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>産業<rp>(</rp><rt>さんぎょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はみんな<ruby>好景気<rp>(</rp><rt>こうけいき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>沸<rp>(</rp><rt>わ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">城市的所有行业都处于良好的经济状态。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">湧く</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">わく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">涌出；喷出；冒出（水等）；出现；冒出（汗、泪等）；流汗；流泪；产生；涌现；油然而生（喜悦、勇气等感情）；浮现（念头、云等）；孵化；繁殖；滋生；寄生（寄生虫等）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"229136\">いざとなれば<ruby>勇気<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆうき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>湧<rp>(</rp><rt>わ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いてくる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">如果需要的话,就会有勇气。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">惑星</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">わくせい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">行星；黑马；意外的竞争者</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"185081\"><ruby>海王星<rp>(</rp><rt>かいおうせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>太陽系<rp>(</rp><rt>たいようけい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の8<ruby>番目<rp>(</rp><rt>ばんめ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>惑星<rp>(</rp><rt>わくせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">海王星是太阳系第八个行星。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/845140\" title=\"Tatoeba · fucongcong\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · fucongcong\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">訳</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">わけ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">原因；理由；根据；意思；含义；理智；道理；情况；情形；事由；恋情；风流韵事</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"213944\">そういうわけで<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はこんなに<ruby>早<rp>(</rp><rt>はや</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>く<ruby>帰<rp>(</rp><rt>かえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>って<ruby>来<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たのです。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这就是为什么我很快就回来了。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">分ける</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">わける</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">分割；分开；分离；分类；分出；分享；分配；分给；分发；区分；区别；辨别；区隔；劝阻；调停；制止（打斗）；打成平手；战成平局；挤过；穿过（人群）；售出；卖出</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"176861\"><ruby>君<rp>(</rp><rt>きみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>夢<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆめ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>と<ruby>現実<rp>(</rp><rt>げんじつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>分<rp>(</rp><rt>わ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けることができないのか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你能不能把梦想与现实分开吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">技</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">わざ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">技巧；技艺；技能；招式</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"147997\"><ruby>柔道<rp>(</rp><rt>じゅうどう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>では<ruby>力<rp>(</rp><rt>ちから</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>より<ruby>技<rp>(</rp><rt>わざ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のほうが<ruby>大切<rp>(</rp><rt>たいせつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>である。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">在犹大,技能比力量更重要。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">わざと</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">故意；有意；刻意</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"120658\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がわざとそうしたとも<ruby>思<rp>(</rp><rt>おも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他似乎不是故意这样做的。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">わざわざ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">特意；费力；不怕麻烦；故意；有意；刻意</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"191995\">わざわざおいでにならなくて<ruby>結構<rp>(</rp><rt>けっこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">足够不必来。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">忘れ物</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">わすれもの</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">遗失物；遗落的东西；忘带东西；落下东西；遗落物品</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"81395\"><ruby>妹<rp>(</rp><rt>いもうと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はせっかちだからよく<ruby>忘<rp>(</rp><rt>わす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れ<ruby>物<rp>(</rp><rt>もの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をする。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我的妹妹很生气,所以我经常忘记。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">忘れる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">わすれる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><sp